{
  "assessment": "The source provides the asymptotic MSD scaling exponent gamma(alpha) for the RILW model, with alpha=2 giving gamma=1 and alpha=4 giving gamma=1.5. The normalized MSD ratio M(r)=r^gamma is a derived quantity consistent with the power-law scaling. The extraction is complete and case_authoring_ready is true.",
